Name:           voov-meeting
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        @RELEASE@
Summary:        Unofficial native VooV Meeting Linux client (patched Tencent Meeting)
License:        Proprietary
URL:            https://github.com/hominluo/voov-meeting-linux
BuildArch:      x86_64
AutoReqProv:    no

Requires:       nss
Requires:       libX11
Requires:       pulseaudio-libs
Requires:       libgcrypt
Requires:       dbus-libs
Requires:       systemd-libs
Requires:       desktop-file-utils

%define _binary_payload w9.xzdio
# The payload is Tencent's Qt application tree; AutoReqProv is off and the
# files are installed verbatim.
%define __arch_install_post %{nil}
%global debug_package %{nil}

%description
VooV Meeting is Tencent's international video-conferencing client.

Tencent ships VooV only for Windows and macOS; its official Linux client is
the China-only Tencent Meeting. This package takes that official client
(Tencent Meeting @VERSION@ for Linux), patches its regional settings and
endpoint tables so it connects to VooV's servers, and packages it with native
Linux desktop integration. No Wine is involved.

This is an unofficial community build. The bundled application is proprietary
Tencent software; only the packaging and helper scripts are MIT licensed.

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
cp -a /src/build/rpm-root/. %{buildroot}/

%files
/opt/voov-meeting
/usr/bin/voov-meeting
/usr/share/applications/voov-meeting.desktop
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/*/apps/voov-meeting.png
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/voov-meeting.svg
/usr/share/pixmaps/voov-meeting.png
/usr/share/doc/voov-meeting

%changelog
* Mon Nov 16 2026 Homin Luo <homin.ro@gmail.com> - @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
- Native VooV Meeting @VERSION@ (patched Tencent Meeting for Linux)